{"id": "vaccine-next-en", "language": "en", "question": "Which vaccine does my baby need next?", "facts": ["Child: Tobi, 6 weeks old.", "Next vaccines due 14 Oct 2026: Pentavalent 1, OPV 1, PCV 1 and Rotavirus 1 (they protect against diphtheria, whooping cough, tetanus, hepatitis B, Hib, polio, pneumonia and diarrhoea).", "Nearest facility for immunization: Agodi PHC (1.2 km), usually open Mon-Fri 08:00-16:00 (hours not confirmed).", "Routine vaccines are free at public health facilities."], "guidance": ["NPHCDA schedule: at 6 weeks give Pentavalent 1, OPV 1, PCV 1 and Rotavirus 1."], "expect": {"include_any": ["Pentavalent"]}}
